 "hadiths": [
  {
   "narrated": "Abu Huraira reported Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) as saying:",
   "text": "There is none whose deeds alone would entitle him to get into Paradise. It was said to him: And, Allah's Messenger, not even you? Thereupon he said: Not even I, but that my Lord wraps me in Mercy.",
   "english_full": "Abu Huraira reported Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) as saying:\n\nThere is none whose deeds alone would entitle him to get into Paradise. It was said to him: And, Allah's Messenger, not even you? Thereupon he said: Not even I, but that my Lord wraps me in Mercy.",
